From 25a172bc47a189bd92f9893d2038328360bb454e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ientzy <ientzy@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 15:02:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/9] Flash Next DFlash2: Spark 8-bit drafter layout and fused
 kernels

The drafter loads q8_g32_fp16 weights when the file set shares
[key; value; query] and [gate; up] in single objects (graft_dflash2.py --q8).
New: five q8 linear shapes, fused context K/V store, Q/K/V split with
norm and rotation, packed SwiGLU. The BF16 file set still loads.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
